{"cue": 1, "end_ms": 9825, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 8096, "text": "Thanks."}
{"cue": 2, "end_ms": 12625, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 10532, "text": "Coming through."}
{"cue": 3, "end_ms": 15833, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 13501, "text": "- Darn.\n- That makes six in a row."}
{"cue": 4, "end_ms": 17471, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 16004, "text": "You owe me another buck."}
{"cue": 5, "end_ms": 19834, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 17639, "text": "Get you next time."}
{"cue": 6, "end_ms": 24369, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 22310, "text": "That will be all."}
{"cue": 7, "end_ms": 28408, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 25280, "text": "Whew. How long you been\nin that Research Department now?"}
{"cue": 8, "end_ms": 29607, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 28583, "text": "Two weeks."}
{"cue": 9, "end_ms": 33185, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 29784, "text": "You must've spent all that time\nfiguring out the fastest route up here."}
{"cue": 10, "end_ms": 35152, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 33355, "text": "Think what you want."}
{"cue": 11, "end_ms": 38315, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 35323, "text": "You know, if I hadn't caught my robe\non that drinking fountain..."}
{"cue": 12, "end_ms": 41360, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 38493, "text": "People wouldn't have shouted\n\"pervert\" at you."}
{"cue": 13, "end_ms": 43121, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 41529, "text": "Yeah, you're right."}
{"cue": 14, "end_ms": 44356, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 43298, "text": "Hi, judge. Hi, Kristen."}
{"cue": 15, "end_ms": 45863, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 44532, "text": "Hey, Bull."}
{"cue": 16, "end_ms": 47626, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 46034, "text": "She beat you again, huh, sir?"}
{"cue": 17, "end_ms": 52037, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 49170, "text": "- What can I do for you?\n- I might be late for this session."}
{"cue": 18, "end_ms": 54505, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 52207, "text": "One of the prisoners escaped\nand is on the loose."}
{"cue": 19, "end_ms": 55904, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 54676, "text": "Is he dangerous?"}
{"cue": 20, "end_ms": 57101, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 56077, "text": "I doubt it."}
{"cue": 21, "end_ms": 59712, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 57312, "text": "Some pervert who just tried\nto take a sponge bath..."}
{"cue": 22, "end_ms": 62042, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 59881, "text": "...in one of the water fountains."}
{"cue": 23, "end_ms": 67487, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 65553, "text": "They say he was wearing a dress too."}
{"cue": 24, "end_ms": 76991, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 73328, "text": "- Don't worry, we'll get him.\n- Yeah, good luck."}
{"cue": 25, "end_ms": 79893, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 78266, "text": "Well, first offense."}
{"cue": 26, "end_ms": 81399, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 80068, "text": "Time off for good behavior."}
{"cue": 27, "end_ms": 83628, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 81569, "text": "Shouldn't be too bad."}
{"cue": 28, "end_ms": 86004, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 84139, "text": "Hey, Harry, did you hear?"}
{"cue": 29, "end_ms": 90235, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 86174, "text": "Yeah, I heard. Some sicko in a dress tried\nto rinse himself off in a drinking fountain."}
{"cue": 30, "end_ms": 93404, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 90412, "text": "Why don't we all notify the media, huh?"}
{"cue": 31, "end_ms": 97147, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 93848, "text": "I was gonna say\nthe bank approved my car loan."}
{"cue": 32, "end_ms": 98580, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 97318, "text": "Oh."}
{"cue": 33, "end_ms": 100084, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 98787, "text": "Happy payments."}
{"cue": 34, "end_ms": 101449, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 100255, "text": "Yeah, thanks."}
{"cue": 35, "end_ms": 104854, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 101623, "text": "- Anybody up for some coffee?\n- Oh, no, I have to go meet with a client."}
{"cue": 36, "end_ms": 107961, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 105026, "text": "- Yeah, and I gotta...\n- Have your fingerprints changed."}
{"cue": 37, "end_ms": 109994, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 108129, "text": "That might help."}
{"cue": 38, "end_ms": 112259, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 110598, "text": "See you guys later."}
{"cue": 39, "end_ms": 114265, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 112434, "text": "Thanks, Mac."}
{"cue": 40, "end_ms": 116734, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 114869, "text": "Hey, great."}
{"cue": 41, "end_ms": 119567, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 116905, "text": "I had a side bet with him."}
{"cue": 42, "end_ms": 121999, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 120475, "text": "Billie."}
{"cue": 43, "end_ms": 124509, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 122177, "text": "Your Honor."}
{"cue": 44, "end_ms": 128414, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 125013, "text": "I saw that water-fountain incident."}
{"cue": 45, "end_ms": 139922, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 137192, "text": "But I couldn't make out his face."}
{"cue": 46, "end_ms": 145730, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 141396, "text": "Excuse me. I'm gonna go\ntake an English refresher course."}
{"cue": 47, "end_ms": 147658, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 146634, "text": "Sir, wait a minute."}
{"cue": 48, "end_ms": 150236, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 147836, "text": "- Not another penny, Mac.\n- Oh, no, sir. No, sir."}
{"cue": 49, "end_ms": 151963, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 150405, "text": "I just want to give you this."}
{"cue": 50, "end_ms": 156975, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 152140, "text": "It came special delivery\nfrom the mayor's office. Heh."}
{"cue": 51, "end_ms": 160612, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 157745, "text": "Yeah, it's an invitation."}
{"cue": 52, "end_ms": 164616, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 160782, "text": "Well, it wasn't marked \"personal\"\nso I opened it."}
{"cue": 53, "end_ms": 169018, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 165787, "text": "It's pretty exciting."}
{"cue": 54, "end_ms": 174223, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 172494, "text": "- \"The Honorable Harold T...\"\n- \"Stone.\""}
{"cue": 55, "end_ms": 177489, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 174395, "text": "It's a big reception\nand they want you to make a speech too."}
{"cue": 56, "end_ms": 181197, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 178933, "text": "- Particulars, Mac?\n- Eight o'clock, next Saturday."}
{"cue": 57, "end_ms": 183200, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 181369, "text": "- Cocktails at 7, black tie.\n- Thank you."}
{"cue": 58, "end_ms": 185271, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 183371, "text": "Oh, my pleasure, sir."}
{"cue": 59, "end_ms": 187101, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 185440, "text": "Look, Mac, do me a favor."}
{"cue": 60, "end_ms": 190676, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 187275, "text": "Don't mention that invitation\nto anyone else, all right?"}
{"cue": 61, "end_ms": 192540, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 190845, "text": "Especially..."}
{"cue": 62, "end_ms": 196377, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 192714, "text": "Please, take me with you!"}
{"cue": 63, "end_ms": 247592, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 246568, "text": "All rise."}
{"cue": 64, "end_ms": 251198, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 249003, "text": "Criminal court, part two,\nis now in session."}
{"cue": 65, "end_ms": 253863, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 251372, "text": "The Honorable Harold T. Stone presiding."}
{"cue": 66, "end_ms": 255600, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 254042, "text": "- You may be seat...\nAah!"}
{"cue": 67, "end_ms": 257039, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 255777, "text": "That's the man!"}
{"cue": 68, "end_ms": 259510, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 257212, "text": "He did the most disgusting thing!"}
{"cue": 69, "end_ms": 262275, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 259681, "text": "He exposed himself!"}
{"cue": 70, "end_ms": 276194, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 274829, "text": "So, uh, ha, ha, ha..."}
{"cue": 71, "end_ms": 279595, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 276364, "text": "Must be a full moon out tonight, huh?"}
{"cue": 72, "end_ms": 283629, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 280034, "text": "No, I think everybody's just on edge\nbecause that creep's still on the loose."}
{"cue": 73, "end_ms": 285199, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 284005, "text": "We'll get him."}
{"cue": 74, "end_ms": 290140, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 285373, "text": "Police artist made a composite based on\neyewitness descriptions and, uh..."}
{"cue": 75, "end_ms": 297576, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 295483, "text": "Better let me take that, huh?"}
{"cue": 76, "end_ms": 302787, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 299420, "text": "- So I hear congratulations are in order.\n- I beg your pardon?"}
{"cue": 77, "end_ms": 306757, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 302957, "text": "Oh, come on. Don't be modest.\nA speech at the mayor's, that's big stuff."}
{"cue": 78, "end_ms": 309658, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 306928, "text": "Yes, sir,\nand we are fiercely proud of you."}
{"cue": 79, "end_ms": 313466, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 310531, "text": "And I swear, I won't do a thing\nto draw attention to myself."}
{"cue": 80, "end_ms": 315569, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 313635, "text": "- No.\n- I've got a bad suit."}
{"cue": 81, "end_ms": 318171, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 315737, "text": "I could pass for a Democrat."}
{"cue": 82, "end_ms": 320533, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 319407, "text": "No."}
{"cue": 83, "end_ms": 322369, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 320708, "text": "First case, Your Honor."}
{"cue": 84, "end_ms": 324670, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 322543, "text": "<i>People v. The Reader family.</i>"}
{"cue": 85, "end_ms": 327238, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 325213, "text": "- Wow.\nOoh."}
{"cue": 86, "end_ms": 329007, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 327415, "text": "Oh."}
{"cue": 87, "end_ms": 331811, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 329684, "text": "Dad, that's the jury box, isn't it?"}
{"cue": 88, "end_ms": 333283, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 331986, "text": "Yes, son, it is."}
{"cue": 89, "end_ms": 337220, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 333454, "text": "But there's no jury tonight,\nbecause we are in?"}
{"cue": 90, "end_ms": 339053, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 337392, "text": "- Jenny?\n- Arraignment court."}
{"cue": 91, "end_ms": 341559, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 339227, "text": "Very good."}
{"cue": 92, "end_ms": 346059, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 342430, "text": "Brian, can you spell arraignment?"}
{"cue": 93, "end_ms": 351698, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 347068, "text": "A-R-R-A-l..."}
{"cue": 94, "end_ms": 353131, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 352073, "text": "N."}
{"cue": 95, "end_ms": 354941, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 353508, "text": "G, it's silent."}
{"cue": 96, "end_ms": 362940, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 360415, "text": "What must you think of me?"}
{"cue": 97, "end_ms": 364911, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 363785, "text": "What's the charge, Mac?"}
{"cue": 98, "end_ms": 369682, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 365086, "text": "\"Destruction of property,\ndisturbing the peace, aggravated assault.\""}
{"cue": 99, "end_ms": 371085, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 369857, "text": "Assault?"}
{"cue": 100, "end_ms": 374626, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 371259, "text": "A-S-S-A-U-L-T."}
{"cue": 101, "end_ms": 378591, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 375963, "text": "Go to your desk and take a N-A-P."}
{"cue": 102, "end_ms": 381127, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 379500, "text": "Yes, sir."}
{"cue": 103, "end_ms": 385461, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 383971, "text": "You must be the Readers."}
{"cue": 104, "end_ms": 387608, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 385640, "text": "- Yes, sir. I'm Tom.\n- I'm Sally."}
{"cue": 105, "end_ms": 390505, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 387775, "text": "- I'm Brian.\n- And I'm Jenny."}
{"cue": 106, "end_ms": 394678, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 390912, "text": "Apparently,\nKaren and Cubby were lost in the shuffle."}
{"cue": 107, "end_ms": 399153, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 397185, "text": "What is the story, Mr. Prosecutor?"}
{"cue": 108, "end_ms": 402346, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 399320, "text": "Your Honor, the Readers were staying\nat the Go Yankees Motel..."}
{"cue": 109, "end_ms": 405390, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 402523, "text": "...just a few blocks from here,\nwhen the police were called..."}
{"cue": 110, "end_ms": 407960, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 405560, "text": "...by the manager,\na \"Mr. Blacky Buzzlick.\""}
{"cue": 111, "end_ms": 409323, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 408129, "text": "Blacky Buzzlick?"}
{"cue": 112, "end_ms": 411624, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 409497, "text": "My friends call me Lonnie."}
{"cue": 113, "end_ms": 414333, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 412433, "text": "And for good reason, no doubt."}
{"cue": 114, "end_ms": 416834, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 414502, "text": "Mr. Buzzlick,\nwould you mind approaching the bench?"}
{"cue": 115, "end_ms": 419736, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 417472, "text": "Your Honor, when the police arrived\nthey found..."}
{"cue": 116, "end_ms": 423206, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 419907, "text": "...that Mr. And Mrs. America here\nhad destroyed their rooms..."}
{"cue": 117, "end_ms": 426905, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 423378, "text": "...and were flinging the contents thereof\nat Mr. Buzzlick."}
{"cue": 118, "end_ms": 429777, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 427081, "text": "Your Honor, the Readers booked their room\nmonths ago..."}
{"cue": 119, "end_ms": 432419, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 429951, "text": "<i>...based on an ad\nin Knuckleball Magazine.</i>"}
{"cue": 120, "end_ms": 436023, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 432587, "text": "They had no way of knowing\nit was an X-rated motel."}
{"cue": 121, "end_ms": 439284, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 436190, "text": "It says right here,\n\"An oasis of adult pleasure.\""}
{"cue": 122, "end_ms": 443157, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 439460, "text": "We thought that meant\na babysitting service."}
{"cue": 123, "end_ms": 450434, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 448136, "text": "Your Honor,\nwhile the people sympathize..."}
{"cue": 124, "end_ms": 455702, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 450605, "text": "...with the plight of Ozzy\nand his brood here, the fact remains..."}
{"cue": 125, "end_ms": 458072, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 455877, "text": "...they signed an agreement\nwith Mr. Buzzlick..."}
{"cue": 126, "end_ms": 461545, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 458246, "text": "...and he is well within his rights\nto withhold any moneys deposited."}
{"cue": 127, "end_ms": 465117, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 461716, "text": "Hey, they pay the damages,\nthey're more than welcome to stay."}
{"cue": 128, "end_ms": 467220, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 465286, "text": "I'll never go back there."}
{"cue": 129, "end_ms": 468582, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 467388, "text": "It was awful."}
{"cue": 130, "end_ms": 471247, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 468756, "text": "The toys were nice, though."}
{"cue": 131, "end_ms": 473584, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 472560, "text": "Toys?"}
{"cue": 132, "end_ms": 478789, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 473761, "text": "Some items of amusement\nincluded at no extra charge."}
{"cue": 133, "end_ms": 481698, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 479901, "text": "Oh, my God."}
{"cue": 134, "end_ms": 486634, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 483938, "text": "All right, people, give me some air, huh?"}
{"cue": 135, "end_ms": 491909, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 488075, "text": "Mr. And Mrs. Reader, I'm afraid\nI have no choice but to find you guilty."}
{"cue": 136, "end_ms": 493376, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 492079, "text": "Oh, that's okay, Your Honor."}
{"cue": 137, "end_ms": 496312, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 493548, "text": "It'll just bring us closer together."}
{"cue": 138, "end_ms": 500777, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 497785, "text": "You put your picture\non your Christmas cards, don't you?"}
{"cue": 139, "end_ms": 508929, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 506961, "text": "What's next on the hit parade, Mac?"}
{"cue": 140, "end_ms": 510120, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 509096, "text": "That's chowtime, sir."}
{"cue": 141, "end_ms": 512493, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 510298, "text": "All right, dinner, everybody."}
{"cue": 142, "end_ms": 522399, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 520875, "text": "Bull."}
{"cue": 143, "end_ms": 525671, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 522577, "text": "Any luck with the von Trapp family?"}
{"cue": 144, "end_ms": 527607, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 526481, "text": "No, sir. Not yet."}
{"cue": 145, "end_ms": 531115, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 527782, "text": "Called every agency in town,\nbut they don't qualify for any kind of aid."}
{"cue": 146, "end_ms": 533719, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 531285, "text": "Is there anybody in Ohio\nthey can write to for money?"}
{"cue": 147, "end_ms": 536823, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 533888, "text": "No family, no friends."}
{"cue": 148, "end_ms": 538823, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 537492, "text": "But that just..."}
{"cue": 149, "end_ms": 544024, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 541829, "text": "Brings them closer together."}
{"cue": 150, "end_ms": 545426, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 544198, "text": "Yeah, I know."}
{"cue": 151, "end_ms": 548626, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 545600, "text": "- Keep working on it, huh, Bull?\n- Yes, sir."}
{"cue": 152, "end_ms": 558110, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 556677, "text": "You can have half my sandwich."}
{"cue": 153, "end_ms": 569985, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 567755, "text": "- Hey, A.J. Foyt.\n- Want a rematch?"}
{"cue": 154, "end_ms": 572625, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 570157, "text": "No, I can't afford it. Come on in."}
{"cue": 155, "end_ms": 574988, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 572793, "text": "I got the Lansing files\nyou wanted copies of."}
{"cue": 156, "end_ms": 576595, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 575162, "text": "Great."}
{"cue": 157, "end_ms": 580359, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 576764, "text": "You are doing wonders for the efficiency\nof that research department."}
{"cue": 158, "end_ms": 583265, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 580535, "text": "Thanks.\nI mean, it's nice of you to notice."}
{"cue": 159, "end_ms": 586167, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 583437, "text": "- Want some freeze-dried enchiladas?\n- No, thanks. Harry..."}
{"cue": 160, "end_ms": 587739, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 586340, "text": "They're the latest thing."}
{"cue": 161, "end_ms": 589934, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 587909, "text": "All you do is add water..."}
{"cue": 162, "end_ms": 592636, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 590111, "text": "...and, voilâ, you got..."}
{"cue": 163, "end_ms": 594848, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 592914, "text": "...hot, wet garbage."}
{"cue": 164, "end_ms": 597109, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 595016, "text": "- Hey, Harry.\n- Yeah?"}
{"cue": 165, "end_ms": 602255, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 598319, "text": "Saturday, there's this kind of prom thing\nto celebrate my prelaw graduating class..."}
{"cue": 166, "end_ms": 605790, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 602423, "text": "...and I thought\nyou might wanna go with me."}
{"cue": 167, "end_ms": 608188, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 606527, "text": "Gee, Kristen, I would love to go..."}
{"cue": 168, "end_ms": 611490, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 608362, "text": "...but I've got a date at the mayor's\non Saturday."}
{"cue": 169, "end_ms": 614732, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 613367, "text": "Oh."}
{"cue": 170, "end_ms": 615960, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 614902, "text": "I'm sorry."}
{"cue": 171, "end_ms": 619971, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 616137, "text": "Maybe next time, huh?\nLike when you graduate post-law school."}
{"cue": 172, "end_ms": 624368, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 620341, "text": "Yeah, right. Sure, it's a date."}
{"cue": 173, "end_ms": 627608, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 624912, "text": "Well, I gotta go now. See you later."}
{"cue": 174, "end_ms": 630444, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 627782, "text": "Okay, tomorrow night\nI'll be back in shape for a rematch."}
{"cue": 175, "end_ms": 633346, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 631719, "text": "Sure."}
{"cue": 176, "end_ms": 644423, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 641329, "text": "Hey, Kristen,\nyou wanna grab a bite to eat?"}
{"cue": 177, "end_ms": 647030, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 645199, "text": "No, thanks."}
{"cue": 178, "end_ms": 650598, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 647401, "text": "I'm having tacos with Fritz Mondale\nin the park."}
{"cue": 179, "end_ms": 652204, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 650771, "text": "Kristen?"}
{"cue": 180, "end_ms": 654841, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 652373, "text": "Kristen. Kristen."}
{"cue": 181, "end_ms": 661906, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 659847, "text": "Okay."}
{"cue": 182, "end_ms": 664176, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 662083, "text": "Now it's..."}
{"cue": 183, "end_ms": 665376, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 664352, "text": "...thinner."}
{"cue": 184, "end_ms": 668619, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 666754, "text": "- Yeah?\n- Harry."}
{"cue": 185, "end_ms": 670916, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 668789, "text": "I've just invented fiesta soup."}
{"cue": 186, "end_ms": 673253, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 671092, "text": "Harry, I have to talk to you about Kristen."}
{"cue": 187, "end_ms": 675861, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 673427, "text": "- What's the matter with Kristen?\n- What's the matter?"}
{"cue": 188, "end_ms": 677998, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 676030, "text": "She's devastated,\nthat's what's the matter."}
{"cue": 189, "end_ms": 681760, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 678165, "text": "I told her not to pop a wheelie\non a newly waxed floor."}
{"cue": 190, "end_ms": 684632, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 681936, "text": "- She's not physically hurt.\n- Well, then what's the problem?"}
{"cue": 191, "end_ms": 686830, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 684805, "text": "- You are the problem.\n- Come again?"}
{"cue": 192, "end_ms": 689533, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 687008, "text": "Harry, she asked you\nto go to that prom thing with her."}
{"cue": 193, "end_ms": 691837, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 689710, "text": "And you tell her\nyou have to go to the mayor's."}
{"cue": 194, "end_ms": 693507, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 692313, "text": "- I do.\n- Of course you do."}
{"cue": 195, "end_ms": 695649, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 693681, "text": "But how's she supposed to know that?"}
{"cue": 196, "end_ms": 698879, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 696217, "text": "- I told her.\n- You see?"}
{"cue": 197, "end_ms": 703312, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 701822, "text": "Why are you yelling at me?"}
{"cue": 198, "end_ms": 705118, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 703491, "text": "Because..."}
{"cue": 199, "end_ms": 706759, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 705292, "text": "...I had to yell at somebody."}
{"cue": 200, "end_ms": 708895, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 706927, "text": "Well, as long as there's a good reason."}
{"cue": 201, "end_ms": 712057, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 709964, "text": "I'm sorry, Harry."}
{"cue": 202, "end_ms": 715464, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 712233, "text": "It's just that that poor girl\nfeels so rejected right now."}
{"cue": 203, "end_ms": 717934, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 715636, "text": "Don't tell me she's got a crush on me?"}
{"cue": 204, "end_ms": 719367, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 718105, "text": "No."}
{"cue": 205, "end_ms": 722165, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 720174, "text": "Well, of course she likes you..."}
{"cue": 206, "end_ms": 726507, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 722343, "text": "...but you're the fifth person that she's\nasked to that dance that turned her down."}
{"cue": 207, "end_ms": 729677, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 726947, "text": "- I see.\n- And they all had some imaginative excuses."}
{"cue": 208, "end_ms": 733342, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 729850, "text": "- Such as?\n- A party at the White House for Nancy."}
{"cue": 209, "end_ms": 735386, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 733521, "text": "- Uh-huh.\n- A sudden call to active duty..."}
{"cue": 210, "end_ms": 736580, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 735556, "text": "...by the National Guard."}
{"cue": 211, "end_ms": 738622, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 736757, "text": "- Okay.\n- And my personal favorite:"}
{"cue": 212, "end_ms": 741785, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 738793, "text": "Elective open-heart surgery."}
{"cue": 213, "end_ms": 747626, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 745066, "text": "- Poor kid.\n- Yeah, tell me about it."}
{"cue": 214, "end_ms": 750032, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 747802, "text": "So when I told her\nI had to go to the mayor's..."}
{"cue": 215, "end_ms": 751865, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 750204, "text": "...it sounded like a lot of..."}
{"cue": 216, "end_ms": 753836, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 752039, "text": "Bull muffins."}
{"cue": 217, "end_ms": 756934, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 754875, "text": "I better go find her."}
{"cue": 218, "end_ms": 760713, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 757778, "text": "Billie, would you stir that stuff for me?"}
{"cue": 219, "end_ms": 793976, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 789710, "text": "What in the hell are they smiling about?"}
{"cue": 220, "end_ms": 796643, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 794448, "text": "Take it easy, Dan."}
{"cue": 221, "end_ms": 801151, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 796817, "text": "They're just one big happy family."}
{"cue": 222, "end_ms": 814994, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 810898, "text": "I want your planet of origin,\nand I want it now."}
{"cue": 223, "end_ms": 821071, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 818739, "text": "Harry, ever since I was a little boy\nI had a dream:"}
{"cue": 224, "end_ms": 823073, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 821242, "text": "To go to the mayor's and wear a tuxedo."}
{"cue": 225, "end_ms": 826577, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 823244, "text": "I won't make a scene. I'll be very quiet."}
{"cue": 226, "end_ms": 833076, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 831552, "text": "Hi."}
{"cue": 227, "end_ms": 835119, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 833254, "text": "- Hello.\n- Mind if I join you?"}
{"cue": 228, "end_ms": 838788, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 835990, "text": "No, pull up a wheelchair."}
{"cue": 229, "end_ms": 844320, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 840327, "text": "Kristen, I really do have a date\nat the mayor's on Saturday."}
{"cue": 230, "end_ms": 845965, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 844498, "text": "Oh, I'm sure."}
{"cue": 231, "end_ms": 849125, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 846133, "text": "What about Friday, then?\nDining with the governor?"}
{"cue": 232, "end_ms": 851500, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 849737, "text": "I can understand why you're bitter."}
{"cue": 233, "end_ms": 853503, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 851672, "text": "No, you can't."}
{"cue": 234, "end_ms": 858975, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 856677, "text": "You're right. I can't."}
{"cue": 235, "end_ms": 863716, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 862283, "text": "Wanna see a magic trick?"}
{"cue": 236, "end_ms": 867349, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 864084, "text": "Look, an invitation to the mayor's."}
{"cue": 237, "end_ms": 869853, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 867521, "text": "Now watch as I make it disappear."}
{"cue": 238, "end_ms": 871616, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 870024, "text": "Nothing up my sleeves."}
{"cue": 239, "end_ms": 875228, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 871792, "text": "I say the magic words:"}
{"cue": 240, "end_ms": 878062, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 875696, "text": "Dan, you want the invitation?"}
{"cue": 241, "end_ms": 885733, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 882002, "text": "I will never forget you for this.\nI'm gonna name my first-born after you."}
{"cue": 242, "end_ms": 888704, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 885906, "text": "Unless I prove to be sterile,\nin which case I will buy a dog."}
{"cue": 243, "end_ms": 890935, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 888876, "text": "I will name him Harry."}
{"cue": 244, "end_ms": 894978, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 893113, "text": "May God follow you\nthe rest of your days."}
{"cue": 245, "end_ms": 898346, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 895149, "text": "And may the angel of death not come\nacross your path until you're into your 80s."}
{"cue": 246, "end_ms": 905852, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 903657, "text": "- How'd I do it?\n- Very funny."}
{"cue": 247, "end_ms": 908324, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 906026, "text": "- I thought so.\n- Well, now I'm free."}
{"cue": 248, "end_ms": 910963, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 908495, "text": "So is that invitation to the big shindig\nstill open?"}
{"cue": 249, "end_ms": 915231, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 912433, "text": "I'm sorry, but I don't need this."}
{"cue": 250, "end_ms": 916926, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 915402, "text": "You don't need what?"}
{"cue": 251, "end_ms": 919003, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 917638, "text": "Your sympathy."}
{"cue": 252, "end_ms": 921339, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 919974, "text": "What are you talking about?"}
{"cue": 253, "end_ms": 923499, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 921508, "text": "The little gimp gets her feelings hurt..."}
{"cue": 254, "end_ms": 926271, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 923677, "text": "...so you make a grand gesture\nto make her feel all right."}
{"cue": 255, "end_ms": 928915, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 926447, "text": "I suppose that makes you feel\nlike a great big hero."}
{"cue": 256, "end_ms": 931779, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 929083, "text": "Your Honor.\nYou can't do that."}
{"cue": 257, "end_ms": 934477, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 931952, "text": "Now wait a minute."}
{"cue": 258, "end_ms": 937049, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 934922, "text": "Let's hear his side of it."}
{"cue": 259, "end_ms": 941121, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 939927, "text": "Harry?"}
{"cue": 260, "end_ms": 945993, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 942830, "text": "Kristen, how about you and me\ngo somewhere else and talk about this?"}
{"cue": 261, "end_ms": 949630, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 946467, "text": "There's nothing to talk about."}
{"cue": 262, "end_ms": 953801, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 952106, "text": "You're right."}
{"cue": 263, "end_ms": 955466, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 954408, "text": "What?"}
{"cue": 264, "end_ms": 958111, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 955643, "text": "There's nothing to talk about."}
{"cue": 265, "end_ms": 962139, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 959113, "text": "I wouldn't go to that dance\nif you were the last person on Earth."}
{"cue": 266, "end_ms": 964807, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 962316, "text": "Hey, you can't say that. I'm disabled."}
{"cue": 267, "end_ms": 966282, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 964985, "text": "You sure are."}
{"cue": 268, "end_ms": 968421, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 966453, "text": "Right up here."}
{"cue": 269, "end_ms": 971617, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 969023, "text": "Dan, give me the invitation back."}
{"cue": 270, "end_ms": 974955, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 972760, "text": "Ha-ha-ha. No. She's kidding."}
{"cue": 271, "end_ms": 976790, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 975129, "text": "Look at her, she's kidding."}
{"cue": 272, "end_ms": 979023, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 976964, "text": "- Now.\n- She wants to..."}
{"cue": 273, "end_ms": 980791, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 979199, "text": "Don't do anything I wouldn't do."}
{"cue": 274, "end_ms": 982526, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 980968, "text": "No, wait. Harry, reconsider this."}
{"cue": 275, "end_ms": 1002583, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 999420, "text": "What's the matter,\nnever seen a wimp before?"}
{"cue": 276, "end_ms": 1007823, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1006026, "text": "Yay!"}
{"cue": 277, "end_ms": 1010291, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1008562, "text": "Oh..."}
{"cue": 278, "end_ms": 1012829, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1010497, "text": "Alabama, Jenny."}
{"cue": 279, "end_ms": 1014024, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1013000, "text": "Montgomery."}
{"cue": 280, "end_ms": 1021937, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1019673, "text": "- Um... Nevada.\n- Reno."}
{"cue": 281, "end_ms": 1025670, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1022109, "text": "Ooh.\n- I mean, Carson City."}
{"cue": 282, "end_ms": 1032610, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1029049, "text": "Even Richard Dawson\nwould hate these people."}
{"cue": 283, "end_ms": 1035054, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1033587, "text": "Hey, Bull. How'd you do?"}
{"cue": 284, "end_ms": 1038623, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1035222, "text": "I hit everybody in the guards' lounge,\nthe cops, the DA's office."}
{"cue": 285, "end_ms": 1040316, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1038792, "text": "And?"}
{"cue": 286, "end_ms": 1043156, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1040494, "text": "Fifty-two dollars and 27 cents."}
{"cue": 287, "end_ms": 1046424, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1043330, "text": "- Well, that will get them to Queens.\n- Well, Mr. Shannon?"}
{"cue": 288, "end_ms": 1048261, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1046600, "text": "I'm afraid it just isn't enough."}
{"cue": 289, "end_ms": 1050062, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1048435, "text": "That's all right, Bull."}
{"cue": 290, "end_ms": 1052262, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1050237, "text": "At least you tried."}
{"cue": 291, "end_ms": 1059705, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1056577, "text": "And that's all that really matters,\nisn't it, Mom?"}
{"cue": 292, "end_ms": 1061507, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1059880, "text": "Yes, dear."}
{"cue": 293, "end_ms": 1062979, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1061682, "text": "That's all we can do."}
{"cue": 294, "end_ms": 1064981, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1063150, "text": "That's all any of us can do."}
{"cue": 295, "end_ms": 1069987, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1065152, "text": "Just put our nose to the grindstone,\nour shoulder to the wheel, and just try."}
{"cue": 296, "end_ms": 1074389, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1070157, "text": "What difference does it make\nif we're stuck here forever?"}
{"cue": 297, "end_ms": 1078797, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1075396, "text": "At least we're stuck together."}
{"cue": 298, "end_ms": 1090903, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1088742, "text": "Bon voyage."}
{"cue": 299, "end_ms": 1096475, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1093881, "text": "I swear to you, Harry, it moved."}
{"cue": 300, "end_ms": 1103246, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1100254, "text": "- Can I come in?\n- Sure."}
{"cue": 301, "end_ms": 1106393, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1103424, "text": "- There, it did it again.\n- Billie, will you excuse us?"}
{"cue": 302, "end_ms": 1108926, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1106560, "text": "Don't go near it.\nThere's something's down there."}
{"cue": 303, "end_ms": 1111997, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1109096, "text": "- See you in court.\n- It was the hot water, brought it to life."}
{"cue": 304, "end_ms": 1113827, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1112166, "text": "- Right.\n- Wait, wait, electricity."}
{"cue": 305, "end_ms": 1117835, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1114001, "text": "You've seen those movies.\nThey always kill it with electricity."}
{"cue": 306, "end_ms": 1122400, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1120307, "text": "So, what can I do for you?"}
{"cue": 307, "end_ms": 1126675, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1123444, "text": "- Hit me over the head with a baseball bat?\n- Lf you think it will help."}
{"cue": 308, "end_ms": 1128614, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1127147, "text": "It might."}
{"cue": 309, "end_ms": 1130977, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1128782, "text": "I just talked to Dan."}
{"cue": 310, "end_ms": 1134848, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1131151, "text": "Turns out you really did have an invitation\nto the mayor's."}
{"cue": 311, "end_ms": 1138924, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1135022, "text": "I could've sworn I said that to someone\njust a little while ago."}
{"cue": 312, "end_ms": 1140583, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1139093, "text": "You did."}
{"cue": 313, "end_ms": 1149201, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1146266, "text": "I apologize for not believing in you."}
{"cue": 314, "end_ms": 1151360, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1149369, "text": "Not accepted."}
{"cue": 315, "end_ms": 1154498, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1153440, "text": "Okay."}
{"cue": 316, "end_ms": 1158702, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1154675, "text": "Not accepted until you agree\nto take people at face value."}
{"cue": 317, "end_ms": 1161507, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1158879, "text": "I've tried that before and it didn't work."}
{"cue": 318, "end_ms": 1164651, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1161682, "text": "Well, you didn't try it with me."}
{"cue": 319, "end_ms": 1168580, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1166487, "text": "Innocent until proven guilty?"}
{"cue": 320, "end_ms": 1170114, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1169022, "text": "What else is there?"}
{"cue": 321, "end_ms": 1171723, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1170290, "text": "Initial distrust."}
{"cue": 322, "end_ms": 1174952, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1171892, "text": "Boy, that makes you wanna wake up\nevery morning, doesn't it?"}
{"cue": 323, "end_ms": 1179759, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1175129, "text": "But you changed your mind\nbecause you felt sorry for me, didn't you?"}
{"cue": 324, "end_ms": 1182026, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1180434, "text": "- Yeah.\n- See?"}
{"cue": 325, "end_ms": 1184602, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1182202, "text": "But if I hadn't had other plans..."}
{"cue": 326, "end_ms": 1188104, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1184771, "text": "...how do you know that I wouldn't have\nwanted to go with you?"}
{"cue": 327, "end_ms": 1192740, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1191011, "text": "Would you have?"}
{"cue": 328, "end_ms": 1196975, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1194848, "text": "- How old are you?\n- Twenty-one."}
{"cue": 329, "end_ms": 1198675, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1197151, "text": "Absolutely."}
{"cue": 330, "end_ms": 1202982, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1201788, "text": "- Who is it?\nDan."}
{"cue": 331, "end_ms": 1205756, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1203891, "text": "- Just a minute.\nOkay."}
{"cue": 332, "end_ms": 1213893, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1209263, "text": "Kristen, I really want to go to that dance\nwith you on Saturday."}
{"cue": 333, "end_ms": 1217328, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1215269, "text": "That would be wonderful."}
{"cue": 334, "end_ms": 1219096, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1218038, "text": "Great."}
{"cue": 335, "end_ms": 1222504, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1219273, "text": "Then we won't need this invitation."}
{"cue": 336, "end_ms": 1227776, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1225979, "text": "- Dan?\nUh-huh."}
{"cue": 337, "end_ms": 1231178, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1229449, "text": "Have fun."}
{"cue": 338, "end_ms": 1242185, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1241161, "text": "- Heh.\n- Aah."}
{"cue": 339, "end_ms": 1245324, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1244198, "text": "Line 1, Your Honor."}
{"cue": 340, "end_ms": 1248093, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1245499, "text": "- Oh, I can't, I'm busy.\n- It's the mayor."}
{"cue": 341, "end_ms": 1254370, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1252072, "text": "Hello, Mr. Mayor?"}
{"cue": 342, "end_ms": 1256008, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1254541, "text": "Hi, yeah."}
{"cue": 343, "end_ms": 1257507, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1256176, "text": "Oh, yeah, me too."}
{"cue": 344, "end_ms": 1261114, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1257678, "text": "Yeah, thank you very much\nfor being so understanding. Uh-huh."}
{"cue": 345, "end_ms": 1262771, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1261281, "text": "Oh, huh?"}
{"cue": 346, "end_ms": 1265441, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1262950, "text": "No, I haven't heard\nthe one about the Republican..."}
{"cue": 347, "end_ms": 1269487, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1265619, "text": "...and the Democrat\nwho were stranded on the desert island, no."}
{"cue": 348, "end_ms": 1271749, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1269656, "text": "Uh-huh. Huh? Heh-heh."}
{"cue": 349, "end_ms": 1274018, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1271925, "text": "Yeah. Ha-ha-ha."}
{"cue": 350, "end_ms": 1279896, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1278565, "text": "That's great."}
{"cue": 351, "end_ms": 1282467, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1280067, "text": "Ed, you municipal nut, you."}
{"cue": 352, "end_ms": 1291274, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1289409, "text": "Gotta go, bye."}
{"cue": 353, "end_ms": 1294340, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1292679, "text": "Kristen?"}
{"cue": 354, "end_ms": 1297379, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1295616, "text": "What do you think?"}
{"cue": 355, "end_ms": 1299479, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1297784, "text": "They go with the rest of me?"}
{"cue": 356, "end_ms": 1302554, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1299653, "text": "- But where...? I mean, how...?\n- I've had them for a while now."}
{"cue": 357, "end_ms": 1305723, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1303357, "text": "Well, then why haven't you\nbeen using them?"}
{"cue": 358, "end_ms": 1308026, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1306126, "text": "Ask Harry."}
{"cue": 359, "end_ms": 1312823, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1310764, "text": "A little testing, maybe?"}
{"cue": 360, "end_ms": 1317232, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1313000, "text": "Seeing if people like you\nfor who you really are, just to be sure?"}
{"cue": 361, "end_ms": 1319838, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1317938, "text": "Something like that."}
{"cue": 362, "end_ms": 1323469, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1322309, "text": "They look terrific."}
{"cue": 363, "end_ms": 1327672, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1325078, "text": "And they don't make\na damn bit of difference."}
{"cue": 364, "end_ms": 1331141, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1329549, "text": "It's still me, huh?"}
{"cue": 365, "end_ms": 1333212, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1331585, "text": "Lucky for me."}
{"cue": 366, "end_ms": 1339754, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1338025, "text": "Harry, I was wondering..."}
{"cue": 367, "end_ms": 1343123, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1339926, "text": "Hey, where'd you get the gams?"}
{"cue": 368, "end_ms": 1347091, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1343530, "text": "Santa filled my Christmas stocking,\nall the way up."}
{"cue": 369, "end_ms": 1350930, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1347267, "text": "Ha-ha. Whoa. Great sense of humor.\nListen, I got my limousine downstairs."}
{"cue": 370, "end_ms": 1353800, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1351104, "text": "Want me to drop you guys off\non my way to His Honor's?"}
{"cue": 371, "end_ms": 1356568, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1353974, "text": "- Sure, why not?\n- Great, let's go."}
{"cue": 372, "end_ms": 1359041, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1356743, "text": "- That your money clip?\n- Oh, yeah, thanks."}
{"cue": 373, "end_ms": 1367651, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1366320, "text": "No."}
{"cue": 374, "end_ms": 1369721, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1367821, "text": "Hey, Dan."}
{"cue": 375, "end_ms": 1372519, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1371325, "text": "Gotcha."}
{"cue": 376, "end_ms": 1377490, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1376330, "text": "You devil."}
{"cue": 377, "end_ms": 1380132, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1377664, "text": "- Yeah. Ha-ha-ha.\n- He had me going."}
{"cue": 378, "end_ms": 1382131, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1380300, "text": "All right,\nI'll see you guys downstairs, huh?"}
{"cue": 379, "end_ms": 1393710, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1389910, "text": "This is gonna be\nthe greatest night of my life."}
{"cue": 380, "end_ms": 1395711, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1393880, "text": "Yeah. Ha-ha-ha."}
